entory_test.go:575:// a JSON number never reaches the walk; the walk holds that order for\\ninternal/terminalbackend/manifest.go:1694:\\t// bound and grammar arms carry no BackendID — and never reaches the\\ninternal/terminalbackend/manifest_test.go:656:// TestManifestDocumentRefusals narrows the closed-schema gate: each case\\ninternal/terminalbackend/manifest_test.go:945:// TestProbeDocumentRefusals narrows the probe closed-schema gate: the same\\ninternal/terminalbackend/manifest_test.go:1093:// TestEvidenceDocumentRefusals narrows the evidence closed-schema gate: the\\ninternal/terminalbackend/refusal_site_audit_test.go:79:// scoped (-run) run never reaches the audit by fullPackageTestRun.\\ninternal/terminalbackend/digit_guard_census_test.go:297:// `:` (0x3A) — the characters adjacent to the digit range — never reach\\ninternal/terminalbackend/identity_ownership_test.go:800:// never reaches the gate through a document because the UTF-8 arm fires\\ninternal/terminalbackend/internal_pin_test.go:283:// pins (including the raw WTF-8 road, which never reaches the gate through\\ninternal/canonicaljson/constraint_inventory_test.go:175:// row whose validator is never reached from an exported entry point. An\\ninternal/canonicaljson/record_conformance_test.go:644:\\t// evidence for a clause it never reached.\\ninternal/canonicaljson/record_conformance_test.go:659:\\t\\t// Deleting the member never reaches validateCommonRecordEnvelope:\\ninternal/canonicaljson/refusal_guards_test.go:31:// on the closed-member sweep and never reaches the per-member type, format or\\ninternal/canonicaljson/core_record_guards_test.go:241:\\t\\t\\t// any other reason, which the previous inference never reached.\\n=== gitignore ===\\n# Curator\\n.agents/\\n.claude/skills/\\n.codex/skills/\\n.cursor/rules/\\n.gemini/skills/\\nSkillfile.dev.json\\n\\n# Project-local temporary artifacts\\n.temp/\\n.task-board/.board-write-ledger.json\\n.DS_Store\\n=== board ===\\nmutation error: parse error at 1:1: unknown operation \\\"checklist\\\" (got \\\"checklist\\\")\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2671,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 668,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
