tation battery with narrowing/arm-deletion/census-only/audit-only + NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL rows, tree OID + exact changed paths recorded there). Battery harness at `/tmp/mutation_battery.sh` (throwaway, not committed).\\nLOGBOOK.md:1058:- FINDING: A twelve-mutant sweep on this leaf reported \\\"12/12 killed, 0 survivors\\\" and the review then found roughly twenty declared bounds with no negative test at all. Widening `bounded(\\\"terminal_id\\\", 1, 512)` to `1, 4096` — an 8x widening of a declared bound — passed `go test ./...`, both fuzz targets and `tracecheck`. The sweep proved only that the twelve hand-picked gates worked.\\nLOGBOOK.md:1104:- FIX: Harness refuses to sweep unless the baseline is green, and reports `NOT-APPLIED` for any mutant that left the tree unchanged. Re-run: 12/12 killed, 0 survivors.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1662,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 416,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
